# Workers static assets cache policy (MISSION-018). Hashed /_astro/* is
# already immutable by default; these cover the named statics.
/thumbs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
/og.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

# Security walls (MISSION-025, hardened 2026-10-18) for the static layer —
# SSR gets the same set from src/middleware.ts (CSP_STRICT / CSP_SESSION).
# Later rules override same-named headers, so the session pages relax CSP
# after the global rule. The script-src hashes below cover every is:inline
# script body in this app (scripts/generate-csp-hashes.mjs, run on build);
# connect-src drops the open https: because every chain/CDN binary goes
# through the same-origin /api/media proxy — regenerate this block by hand
# if a new is:inline script body is added (the generator only writes the
# SSR-side TS file; this static-asset file is kept in sync manually).
